<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Warburg says switch out of Allied.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Warburg says switch out of Allied.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>SBC Warburg advised its clients to switch out of Allied Domecq Plc and into Grand Metropolitan Plc and Guinness Plc, dealers said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Allied, due to report its interim results on May 13, is not expected to meet the growth rates of Grand Met and Guinness, they said.</p>
<p>At 1012 GMT, shares in  Allied were off one penny to 435-1/2p.</p>
<p>Shares in Grand Met and Guinness were up 2-1/2p to 496p and up 5-1/2p to 503p, respectively. --London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
